note The keys of the braille keyboard are Dot1 through Dot8 and Space.
note * A display may have LeftSpace and/or RightSpace in addition to, or instead
note * of, Space. Each of them can be typed with the dot keys. Each of them
note * chords with the dot keys.

assign chord Space+
include ../chords.kti

map Dot1 DOT1
map Dot2 DOT2
map Dot3 DOT3
map Dot4 DOT4
map Dot5 DOT5
map Dot6 DOT6
map Dot7 DOT7
map Dot8 DOT8

map Space SPACE
map LeftSpace SPACE
map RightSpace SPACE
